# hash correctness + quality suite: known-answer vectors, avalanche, collisions
#
#   duck tests/hash/hash.duck          (== duck batch tests/hash/hash.duck)
#
# amd64/x64 hosted. The meow_hash sections are x86-only (they #if-compile out on
# other arches), and the zzz sections need AVX2 on x86 or NEON on arm -- src/hash/zzz.hpp has no
# #else, so below that the family does not exist and the tests gate on __micron_hash_zzz.
# rapidhash / murmur / xxhash / crc / fnv are the genuinely arch-independent ones.

test tests/hash/ -o bin/hash/x64
